ed to a field, it adds nutrients and organic matter to the soil. The organic matter contains about 60% organic carbon. The carbon-to-nitrogen (C:N) ratio shows the proportion of organic carbon to total nitrogen of a manure or organic material.', text_hash: '1060af1ecbe7bc9770808907e2bfabcdb362c3a94b503fe0c9ea73c88fc52429', topic: 'care' } RETURN NONE;
